{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_212_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_212","textTraditional":"一、三十有二年。春王正月，公在乾侯。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_212_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_212","textTraditional":"二、取闞。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_212_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_212","textTraditional":"闞者何？邾婁之邑也。曷為不繫乎邾婁？諱亟也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_212_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_212","textTraditional":"三、夏，吳伐越。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_212_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_212","textTraditional":"四、秋七月。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_212_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_212","textTraditional":"五、冬，仲孫何忌會晉韓不信、齊高張、宋仲幾、衞世叔申、鄭國參、曹人、莒人、邾婁人、薛人、〈木巳〉人、小邾婁人城成周。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_212_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_212","textTraditional":"六、十有二月己未，公薨于乾侯。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}